        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/trust> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/organization> ;
    gmeow:sliceConsumer "Every slice describing people, organizations, or things; the mail corpus; the identity facets."@x-gmeow-english .
